OL,3,GNEWSACall for fairer spread of housing
OL,4,Aacross Guernsey
OL,5,
OL,6,FSt Sampson's douzeniers are calling for
OL,7,Fhousing developments to be distributed
OL,8,Fmore evenly across Guernsey rather than
OL,9,Fthe majority being in the north.
OL,11,FAhead of a States debate on housing
OL,12,Fsite allocations they said they
OL,13,Fsupported the push for more homes, but
OL,14,Fhave concerns about where they are
OL,15,Fbeing built with current proposals
OL,16,Fplacing 57.3% of new housing in the
OL,17,Fnorth of the island.
OL,19,FThe douzeniers said their concerns were
OL,20,Ffocused on the pressure on
OL,21,Finfrastructure rather than opposition
OL,22,Fto new homes being built.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
