OL,3,GNEWSACall for fairer spread of housing
OL,4,Aacross Guernsey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe States Development & Planning
OL,7,FAuthority said "there has been a policy
OL,8,Fdecision to share more fairly the
OL,9,Fbuilding of homes across the island".
